## neg_risk routing
- `MarketCandidate.neg_risk` flag is parsed but NOT explicitly used for routing in order posting
- SDK likely handles internally via token_id — do not add manual routing logic without testing

## What NOT to do
- Do not implement WS user feed (not needed for current architecture)
- Do not switch GTC → GTD without implementing full expiry tracking
- Do not add new Gamma endpoints without checking current docs.polymarket.com first
- Do not remove the double-shape parser (markets_filter.py:251-393) — API shape changes are real